1586:</style></div></div><div   class=" contentBox py-5"  ><div   class=" container width-85"   > <div    ><div class="col-md-12"><h3 class="about-heading"><strong>UG Admission</strong></h3></div><div class="col-lg-12"><p><b>UG Admission Data 2026-27</b></p><p><b><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); font-size: 12px;">ADMITTED STUDENT LIST (BA, BCOM, BSC &amp; BBA Semester-I 2026):</span><span style="font-size: 12px;"> </span><font color="#ff00ff"><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/109QSknZvf5YGtOj1zwIFdtRWWNfjvC66/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><span style="font-size: 12px;">View List</span></a></font></b></p><p><span style="font-weight: 600; margin: 0px;"><font color="#ff0000" style="background-color: rgb(0, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 12px;">WAITING STUDENT LIST (BA, BCOM, BSC &amp; BBA Semester-I 2026):</span></font><span style="font-size: 12px;"> </span><font color="#ff00ff"><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/12AQMZfCMUV1dZ-z63I7CmH-GQsgtPng9/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><span style="font-size: 12px;">View List</span></a></font></span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 600; margin: 0px;"><font color="#311873"><span style="font-size: 12px;">Category Wise Cut-off Marks for Semester-I Admitted &amp; Waiting Students: </span><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/13b-_xJ6wH2zyZM2-CODiwRPC3_y8wz5d/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><span style="font-size: 12px;">View Marks</span></a></font></span></p><p><b><font color="#ff0000"><span style="font-size: 14px;">आवश्यक सूचना :&nbsp;</span></font></b></p><p data-path-to-node="0"><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="18"><span style="font-size: 14px;">सेमेस्टर प्रथम</span></b><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"> में प्रवेश हेतु </span><b><span style="font-size: 14px;">(Admitted &amp; Waiting Students दोनों ) </span></b><span style="font-size: 14px;">को&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">मूल दस्तावेजों (Originals) की जांच करवाकर, नीचे दिए गए क्रम में एक सेट प्रतिलिपि (Photocopy) बनाकर महाविद्यालय में जमा करवाना है:</span></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span style="font-size: 14px;">बधाई संदेश पत्र</span></b><span style="font-size: 14px;"> (Congratulation/Allotment Letter)</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span style="font-size: 14px;">ऑनलाइन आवेदन फॉर्म</span></b><span style="font-size: 14px;"> (Online Application Form)</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span style="font-size: 14px;">10 वीं की अंकतालिका</span></b><span style="font-size: 14px;"> (प्रतिलिपि)</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span style="font-size: 14px;">12 वीं की अंकतालिका</span></b><span style="font-size: 14px;"> (प्रतिलिपि)</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,4,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span style="font-size: 14px;">जाति प्रमाण-पत्र</span></b><span style="font-size: 14px;"> (प्रतिलिपि)</span></p><p data-path-to-node="3,4,0"><span style="font-size: 17.5px; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">(</span><span style="font-size: 14px;">ओ.बी.सी. (OBC) एवं ई.डब्लू.एस. (EWS) प्रमाण-पत्र तीन वर्ष से अधिक पुराने नहीं होने चाहिए।)</span></span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,5,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,5,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span style="font-size: 14px;">मूल निवास प्रमाण-पत्र</span></b><span style="font-size: 14px;"> (प्रतिलिपि)</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,6,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,6,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span style="font-size: 14px;">बोनस अंक हेतु सम्बन्धित प्रमाण-पत्र</span></b><span style="font-size: 14px;"> (प्रतिलिपि) – </span><i data-path-to-node="3,6,0" data-index-in-node="50"><span style="font-size: 14px;">(यदि लागू हो: Games, NCC, NSS, SCOUT, Black Belt, Human Right आदि)</span></i></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,7,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,7,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span style="font-size: 14px;">माइग्रेशन प्रमाण-पत्र</span></b><span style="font-size: 14px;"> (मूल प्रमाण-पत्र / Original)&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,8,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,8,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span style="font-size: 14px;">आय प्रमाण-पत्र</span></b><span style="font-size: 14px;"> (प्रतिलिपि)</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,9,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,9,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span style="font-size: 14px;">T.C. (Transfer Certificate) एवं C.C. (Character Certificate)</span></b><span style="font-size: 14px;"> – </span><i data-path-to-node="3,9,0" data-index-in-node="63"><span style="font-size: 14px;">(शालादर्पण पोर्टल से ऑनलाइन जारी मूल प्रमाण-पत्र)</span></i></p></li></ol><ul data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0"><span style="font-size: 14px;">📅 </span><b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="3"><span style="font-size: 14px;">अंतिम तिथि:</span></b><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"> दस्तावेज़ सत्यापन (DV) व फीस जमा करने की </span><font color="#ff0000"><b><span style="font-size: 14px;">अंतिम तिथि </span></b></font></span><b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="67"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><font color="#ff0000">13 जून 2026</font></span></b><span style="font-size: 14px;"> है।</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0"><span style="font-size: 14px;">👤 </span><b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="3"><span style="font-size: 14px;">अनिवार्य उपस्थिति:</span></b><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"> </span><u><span style="font-size: 14px;">मूल दस्तावेजों की जाँच हेतु विद्यार्थी का स्वयं उपस्थित होना आवश्यक है</span></u><span style="font-size: 14px;">।</span></span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,2,0"><span style="font-size: 14px;">✍️ </span><span style="font-size: 14px;">ऑनलाइन आवेदन फॉर्म एवं मूल दस्तावेजों की समस्त प्रतिलिपियाँ (Photocopies) विद्यार्थी द्वारा स्वयं हस्ताक्षरित होनी चाहिए।</span></p></li></ul><p><span style="font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;">* Visit college website regularly for updates</span></p><p><br></p><p>* Admission Committee Members -</p><p><b>B.A. Semester-I</b></p><p>Prof. HR Alariya (Co-Nodal Officer)</p><p><span style="font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;">Dr. Dhramveer Janu</span></p><p>Dr. Vikas Kumar</p><p><span style="font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;">Dr. Aakaksha Dudi</span></p><p><b>B.Com. Semester-I</b></p><p>Dr. BL Raigar</p><p><b>BBA Semester-I</b></p><p>Dr. Dharmendra Yadav</p><p><b>B.Sc. (Bio) Semester-I</b></p><p>Dr. Rajbala</p><p><span style="font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;">Sh. Suresh Kumar</span></p><p>Smt. Archana Gajraj</p><p><b>B.Sc. (Maths) Semester-I</b></p><p>Dr. Suresh Kumar</p><p><span style="font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;">Sh. BL Gahan</span></p><p>Sh. Ramesh Kumar</p><p><b>Nodal Officer : Sh. GL Deegarwal</b></p><p><b>Co-Ordinator Officer : Sh. Yashpal&nbsp;</b></p></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="6" ><div id="GridContainer_3"></div><div   class=" flat-row footer"  ><div   class=" container-fluid"  ><div   class=" row"  ><div   class=" col-lg-10 col-md-10 col-sm-12 col-12 footerLinks"  ><div   class=" row"  ><div   class=" col-lg-8 col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-12"  > <div    ><style>
